(5617852, 814906, 104230, '<td valign="top">I love frangipani flowers .. great subjects for a photograph. However, this image suffers as the pink flower is not in focus and I find its placement in the center of the image rather "static". I am wondering how you achieved the selective desaturation in basic editing since the background flowers are presumably the same color as the central one?</td>', 'I love frangipani flowers .. great subjects for a photograph. However, this image suffers as the pink flower is not in focus and I find its placement in the center of the image rather "static". I am wondering how you achieved the selective desaturation in basic editing since the background flowers are presumably the same color as the central one?', '2009-08-20 01:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
