(5623628, 814746, 109393, '<td valign="top">nice color, it accents the building nicely. good composition, the building being off center adds more to the bridge which is good and the architecture taking center stage was a good choice. it''s cool that you were able to capture texture with all of the editing that must have happened, whatever it was cool. the sky is a bit bright but that could very well be nature''s fault.</td>', 'nice color, it accents the building nicely. good composition, the building being off center adds more to the bridge which is good and the architecture taking center stage was a good choice. it''s cool that you were able to capture texture with all of the editing that must have happened, whatever it was cool. the sky is a bit bright but that could very well be nature''s fault.', '2009-08-25 21:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5623631, 814261, 109393, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot. the contrast in colors adds an abstract feeling to it. I like the composition of the object. However, it is a bit blury and this takes away some of the detail leaving me questioning what the actual design is just a little. cool photo.</td>', 'beautiful shot. the contrast in colors adds an abstract feeling to it. I like the composition of the object. However, it is a bit blury and this takes away some of the detail leaving me questioning what the actual design is just a little. cool photo.', '2009-08-25 21:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
