(5623858, 814855, 66398, '<td valign="top">Such a beautiful photograph. I''m afraid I don''t see the pink though which will probably end up with a low score for that reason. Not voting on yours because it is so nice but just doesn''t fit into this challenge imo. If the building is pink in real life then your white balance or color corrections need to be worked a little better. Again not giving it a score though.</td>', 'Such a beautiful photograph. I''m afraid I don''t see the pink though which will probably end up with a low score for that reason. Not voting on yours because it is so nice but just doesn''t fit into this challenge imo. If the building is pink in real life then your white balance or color corrections need to be worked a little better. Again not giving it a score though.', '2009-08-25 23:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5623861, 814894, 66398, '<td valign="top">The way you desaturated it (legally of course) also desaturated some color other than pink from the purse which left some portions of the purse in greyscale which isn''t attractive. Not giving a score for now. Back to finish scoring and I love the concept and attempt but the greyscale on the portions of the purse are just a drawback. 5</td>', 'The way you desaturated it (legally of course) also desaturated some color other than pink from the purse which left some portions of the purse in greyscale which isn''t attractive. Not giving a score for now. Back to finish scoring and I love the concept and attempt but the greyscale on the portions of the purse are just a drawback. 5', '2009-08-25 23:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
