(5624027, 814136, 67697, '<td valign="top">Sarah - this is not boring at all.  This is gorgeous!  I love how the petals just flow into the soft background.  Congrats on 5th place!</td>', 'Sarah - this is not boring at all.  This is gorgeous!  I love how the petals just flow into the soft background.  Congrats on 5th place!', '2009-08-26 01:11:26.000000', NULL, 0),
