(5624683, 814629, 66398, '<td valign="top">I really liked this shot during the challenge. It was/is intriguing for sure. I think any photo that makes me look at it longer is a great photo and this was one of those. I did score down a little because the color pink was supposed to be the primary color in the shot and the hat takes up such a small amount of real-estate. In a free study or a different challenge I would have scored much higher. I really loved all the reflections. The grain didn''t even bother me. In fact I don''t think I even realized it til I saw the other comments.<br/> <br/>It''s a beautiful one of a kind shot and I''m glad you got the posthumous blue!! You deserve it.</td>', 'I really liked this shot during the challenge. It was/is intriguing for sure. I think any photo that makes me look at it longer is a great photo and this was one of those. I did score down a little because the color pink was supposed to be the primary color in the shot and the hat takes up such a small amount of real-estate. In a free study or a different challenge I would have scored much higher. I really loved all the reflections. The grain didn''t even bother me. In fact I don''t think I even realized it til I saw the other comments. It''s a beautiful one of a kind shot and I''m glad you got the posthumous blue!! You deserve it.', '2009-08-26 10:31:11.000000', NULL, 0),
