(5624741, 814552, 99412, '<td valign="top">I am impressed. Anything less than a 10 just won''t do. This is a perfect photo....<br/>:)<br/> <br/>There should have been 3 Blue ribbons for this challenge.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-08-26 10:00:53.</i></td>', 'I am impressed. Anything less than a 10 just won''t do. This is a perfect photo....:) There should have been 3 Blue ribbons for this challenge.', '2009-08-26 10:54:37.000000', '2009-08-26 11:00:53.000000', 0),
(5624758, 814314, 87808, '<td valign="top">Hi from the C Club<br/> <br/>You asked for an in depth comment on your shot!  I was one of your 7''s in this shot and here is the reason why.<br/> <br/>I liked that you thought out of the boxx in this one, it is just not the shell or the cup.  you saw two objects and realized that they complimented each other.  The round smooth curves of each of them lend the selves to this shot. There are several things that could have been done a little differently though that may have helped your score somewhat. <br/> <br/>In post processing, boosting the exposure, brightness will have helped with the white that is a little grey here.  Unsharp Mask would have made this a little sharper.  I see that you ISO is very high and this accounts for the grain that can be seen. A faster shutter speed of more natural light would have helped this . <br/> <br/>You did well with the shadows they are soft and inviting, well done!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Hi from the C Club You asked for an in depth comment on your shot!  I was one of your 7''s in this shot and here is the reason why. I liked that you thought out of the boxx in this one, it is just not the shell or the cup.  you saw two objects and realized that they complimented each other.  The round smooth curves of each of them lend the selves to this shot. There are several things that could have been done a little differently though that may have helped your score somewhat.  In post processing, boosting the exposure, brightness will have helped with the white that is a little grey here.  Unsharp Mask would have made this a little sharper.  I see that you ISO is very high and this accounts for the grain that can be seen. A faster shutter speed of more natural light would have helped this .  You did well with the shadows they are soft and inviting, well done! ', '2009-08-26 11:10:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(5624764, 814619, 87808, '<td valign="top">Me again from the C Club!!!<br/> <br/>I gave this shot an 8 whilst in voting, here is why. <br/> <br/>The shot is sharp and crisp, the details are finely tuned.  The pov is excellent, not something you see when you think of portraits angles.  Your pinks are spot on, well done. The only thing I would have done differently would be to crop it a little tighter on the right hand side to get rid of the dead space there. <br/> <br/>I am not sure why the voting was all over the place in this challenge, I can see you got 2-3''s and 4, your comments are all good.  I think you did well congrats!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Me again from the C Club!!! I gave this shot an 8 whilst in voting, here is why.  The shot is sharp and crisp, the details are finely tuned.  The pov is excellent, not something you see when you think of portraits angles.  Your pinks are spot on, well done. The only thing I would have done differently would be to crop it a little tighter on the right hand side to get rid of the dead space there.  I am not sure why the voting was all over the place in this challenge, I can see you got 2-3''s and 4, your comments are all good.  I think you did well congrats! ', '2009-08-26 11:15:39.000000', NULL, 0),
