(5624846, 814176, 30861, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the Undie award. Was one of my high picks in the challenge, actually. I knew, of course, it would suffer at the hands of the voters (just as mine did), but it''s a lovely image nevertheless, and much more interesting the mass of entries.<br/> <br/>BTW, can you explain the title? As far as I can tell, "Honfleur" is a location in France, and "Fraiche" would be "fresh", and I found a "La Fraichette" restaurant in Honfleur, is that the reference?<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-08-26 11:10:37.</i></td>', 'Congrats on the Undie award. Was one of my high picks in the challenge, actually. I knew, of course, it would suffer at the hands of the voters (just as mine did), but it''s a lovely image nevertheless, and much more interesting the mass of entries. BTW, can you explain the title? As far as I can tell, "Honfleur" is a location in France, and "Fraiche" would be "fresh", and I found a "La Fraichette" restaurant in Honfleur, is that the reference?', '2009-08-26 12:05:31.000000', '2009-08-26 12:10:37.000000', 0),
