(5625022, 814629, 30861, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> great shot, great original. I wouldn''t have cropped out the serendipitous cross at right, but who am I to critique a Posthumous Blue?? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>You know, I never noticed that cross :-( My concern was that I wanted to cut the tops off all the windows; I did NOT like how they looked when completed, it was too pat. And that pretty much took care of the cross...</td>', 'Originally posted by posthumous: great shot, great original. I wouldn''t have cropped out the serendipitous cross at right, but who am I to critique a Posthumous Blue??   You know, I never noticed that cross :-( My concern was that I wanted to cut the tops off all the windows; I did NOT like how they looked when completed, it was too pat. And that pretty much took care of the cross...', '2009-08-26 14:35:33.000000', NULL, 0),
