(5626519, 814552, 66515, '<td valign="top">Hi Marbo, I saw your comment about Lightroom''s WB limitations. I saw this article and thought I would share it. I haven''t tried it out personally but it looks like it might work.<br/> <br/>eta: Lets try this again WITH the article:<br/><a href="//lightroom-blog.com/2009/05/creating-ir-camera-profile.html" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//lightroom-blog.com/2009/05/creating-ir-camera-profile.html</a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-08-27 18:08:54.</i></td>', 'Hi Marbo, I saw your comment about Lightroom''s WB limitations. I saw this article and thought I would share it. I haven''t tried it out personally but it looks like it might work. eta: Lets try this again WITH the article://lightroom-blog.com/2009/05/creating-ir-camera-profile.html', '2009-08-27 19:00:18.000000', '2009-08-27 19:08:54.000000', 0),
