(6264312, 814552, 120129, '<td valign="top">Hi, you say that white balance can''t be set in d50... do you mean that I cant set a custom white balance with an ir filter using the nikon d50? thanks, Lauri</td>', 'Hi, you say that white balance can''t be set in d50... do you mean that I cant set a custom white balance with an ir filter using the nikon d50? thanks, Lauri', '2010-12-30 00:03:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(6264413, 814552, 4517, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by overboard:</b></div><hr/><i> Hi, you say that white balance can''t be set in d50... do you mean that I cant set a custom white balance with an ir filter using the nikon d50? thanks, Lauri </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Hi, you can`t do a custom white balance with the ir filter fitted on the D40.<br/> <br/>You can with the D50 which you have. The D50 is must easier for ir than D40. Just set custom WB to sunlit grass with the filter on for perfect brown colours like this <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=473313" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/638/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_473313.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/638/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_473313.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/638/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_473313.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Then swap the blue/red channels for colours like this <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=514948" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/683/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_514948.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/683/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_514948.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/683/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_514948.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Originally posted by overboard: Hi, you say that white balance can''t be set in d50... do you mean that I cant set a custom white balance with an ir filter using the nikon d50? thanks, Lauri   Hi, you can`t do a custom white balance with the ir filter fitted on the D40. You can with the D50 which you have. The D50 is must easier for ir than D40. Just set custom WB to sunlit grass with the filter on for perfect brown colours like this   Then swap the blue/red channels for colours like this ', '2010-12-30 04:26:09.000000', NULL, 0),
